{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Propagate TenantId into the handler context**\n\nThe runner sends `TenantId` when invoking durable children and plain chained targets, but the shim forwards only the qualifier and payload. Tenant-aware JS handlers therefore observe no tenant, preventing this harness from validating tenant propagation. Extract the Invoke tenant metadata, pass it to the worker, expose it on the Lambda context, and test both durable and plain targets.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM75N42m","finding_digest":"2988648910cd511516b0f51bebb2751edad36646b237715fd95f3e532639111f","finding_id":"arf_v1_fgegjciqzvirkfvq6un6xmtvd3","finding_key":"github/scripts/js_examples/lambda-shim.cjs::runserver::tenant-id-propagation","identity_key":"github/scripts/js_examples/lambda-shim.cjs::runserver::tenant-id-propagation","line":118,"observation_digest":"a585b8eeb75e602467ff906402c650b89531760cc7453e98014bc7264b70ed28","observation_id":"aro_v1_uwc3r3vxlzqciz77sbsafrsqxc","path":".github/scripts/js_examples/lambda-shim.cjs","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-05T06:12:22Z","review_id":"arr_v1_6wm2bprwt6d656bvg435c7hxnz","reviewed_base_sha":"631b78d1b505b157eee758662291fc5e2353bbb6","reviewed_head_sha":"612c25e99cea0cff7be65f0bcc0684ba73bd13ce","reviewer":"codex","start_line":112,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":745},"record_id":"art_v1_wue5ostgoqnl3d2nkyi6lbaeit","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-05T06:12:22Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
